## Medical Data Processing Notice

This software is designed for processing medical records and patient data. Users are responsible for:

1. Ensuring compliance with applicable healthcare regulations (HIPAA, GDPR, etc.)
2. Implementing appropriate security measures for sensitive data
3. Obtaining necessary permissions for data processing
4. Following institutional policies and procedures
5. Maintaining data confidentiality and integrity

The authors and contributors of this software assume no responsibility for:
- Compliance with healthcare regulations
- Data security or privacy breaches
- Accuracy of processed medical information
- Any consequences arising from the use of this software

Users must implement appropriate safeguards and follow best practices for medical data handling.